# MuJoCo
# Written to the working directory when the engine hits a problem. Useful to read,
# never useful to commit.
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Data the system produces
# Recordings especially — 1a.4.1 will write a lot of them, and they get big.
# If a specific recording becomes a fixture worth keeping, force-add it:
#     git add -f recordings/known-good-push.json
logs/
recordings/
*.log

# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   .loom/    project state, belongs in version control
#   assets/   models, including the cage — small and hand-authored
